# Local registry pin only. Some machines have a global npm config pointing at
# a private registry proxy, so a local .npmrc is needed to reach public npm.
# It must NOT be committed: it poisons the lockfile with tarball URLs that no
# other machine can resolve, and leaks a private hostname.
.npmrc
